  - "Entre sus grabaciones figuran \xABLight Blue - Live At The Five Spot / August
    7, 1958\xBB y \xABEpistrophy - Live At The Blackhawk / 1960\xBB."
  - "Tambi\xE9n lanz\xF3 \xAB'Round Midnight - Live At The Five Spot / July 9, 1958\xBB."
  - "Es el proyecto musical detr\xE1s de \xABBlue Monk - Live At The Five Spot /
    August 7, 1958\xBB y \xABMisterioso - Live At The Five Spot / August 7, 1958\xBB."
